<article class="legal container"><div class="eyebrow">Legal</div><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>This starter policy is a template and should be reviewed and customized before launch, especially after analytics, advertising, affiliate or contact services are connected.</p><h2>Information</h2><p>CreateLoom may process information that visitors voluntarily provide through contact or other features. Browser storage may be used for preferences such as locally saved favorites.</p><h2>Advertising & analytics</h2><p>If advertising or analytics services are enabled, those services may use cookies or similar technologies according to their own policies. Update this section with the specific providers used on the live site.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Replace this placeholder with your business contact information before publishing.</p></article>
